{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">美银：台积电资本开支加速，美国厂产能爬坡推进</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">台积电董事会批准的资本预算达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">290亿美元</span>，同比增幅<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">99%</span>，这个数字覆盖的是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>前<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>的产能<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>计划。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">BofA</span>在8月18日的研报中强调，预算结构正向前段晶圆扩产倾斜，先进后段封装和特殊制程的占比也在温和<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>。简单说，台积电正在为接下来两年的产能爬坡提前锁设备、锁厂房。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份报告最值得看的判断不是资本开支本身，而是它背后透出的需求能见度。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">BofA</span>根据GPU、ASIC、x86/ARM服务器CPU、网络交换芯片和现有手机SoC的晶圆需求测算，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>资本开支有望落在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">620亿美元</span>指引中值，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>可能冲到800至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">850亿美元</span>，高于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">BofA</span>和市场的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">780亿</span>、750亿美元预期。前提是资本批准节奏能维持在长期趋势上方40%至45%的同比增速。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX5rJSibUTcKM9DUjdfpuzjicW7HTsNibehrVBJkG0CMeXtn5H3vDQQG0gOvcRwgIt56rvFONf97Z0bvDM4ko8Lo8MsO9tfOKiagrs/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 资本预算结构转向前端扩产，厂房建设占比回落</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看一个容易被忽略的细节。过去12个月资本预算中用于设施和无尘室的比例是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">35%</span>，而<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2024</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>的平均值是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">47%</span>。这个占比下降不是坏事，反而说明台积电正从土建阶段进入设备安装阶段。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">BofA</span>认为，预算结构向前段扩产倾斜，加上先进后段封装和特殊制程的温和<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>，表明公司正处于陡峭的产能爬坡期。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把这件事拆开看，资本批准和实际资本开支之间存在时间差。批准预算相当于给供应商下订单，实际付款要等设备交付和安装。所以季度间的资本批准波动很大，但累计同比增速更能反映趋势。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">BofA</span>的图表显示，台积电累计资本批准的同比增速正在重新<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>，这比单季数字更有信号意义。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">35%</span>这个设施占比，它比资本开支总额更早反映扩产阶段。简单说，土建占比下降、设备占比上升，意味着厂房已经就绪，接下来要装机器、跑产能；我更关注的是设备到位后，实际产能开出速度能否匹配资本开支节奏。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVDfxRbvqqGHfqVCMRE1PeAQNKqcJVNtXzEiad74jdnMt4Qa7BScl3sQ5MjGrBIKFqSL6enia6XycuPgt3sxlsAHTmw81UJyJnX0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 亚利桑那厂销售环比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17%</span>，扣除补贴后净利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">38%</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">海外工厂的盈利爬坡是这份报告的另一个看点。亚利桑那厂销售环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17%</span>、同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">145%</span>，达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">450亿</span>新台币，占台积电总销售的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>。更关键的是，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">BofA</span>估算亚利桑那厂扣除政府补贴后的净利率在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>第<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>达到38%，而2025年全年还是负90%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这个<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>幅度需要放到折旧背景里看。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">BofA</span>预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>台积电折旧费用年复合增长率约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20%</span>，主要来自先进制程和特殊制程的资本开支<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>，包括<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2029年</span>与索尼合资生产图像传感器的计划。折旧不确定性下毛利率还能维持在高60%区间，靠的是HPC需求管道和高端手机芯片组带来的定价权。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">亚利桑那厂的盈利<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>如果持续，会直接缓解市场对海外扩产摊薄利润的担忧。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">38%</span>的净利率虽然低于公司平均的约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>，但考虑到工厂还在爬坡期，这个数字已经相当扎实。关键在于利用率和定价能否在后续几个季度维持。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 亚利桑那厂从负<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">90%</span>到正<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">38%</span>的净利率跳跃，说明海外工厂的盈利模型正在被验证。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUwhE0ic2gFiaIibxtgE2AmlfM7lSjId1Nj11GB2kGbXXzZ5xQllppJ1Qn2DhOEDJEMIfIPDYh4j5U36KHxMuDF5R4rEXfsYHJbk4/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWp3dltKq3icduh5SibSRNyd0lR7BAD46JvgjYcmgSlFNlSTnJpibYs85XDfiapQlZybZydriciaafenslrQMKgLnzOj38zMjAsNgpibw/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 12-BofA-Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Co.-2330.TT-Capital appropriation ramping to support demand- US fab ramps progressing well-260818</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
